8</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -8 to take a more decisive step in the negotiation, exploring the potential benefits of a stronger stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to my proposal, particularly Analyst A and Delegate D, to refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly, considering alternative proposals that prioritize increasing the magnitude of x.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-f39cf7cd734c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-f39cf7cd734c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher, and this step seems reasonable for the group. This proposal aims to find a balanced solution that works for everyone.\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-f39cf7cd734c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a balanced solution that works for everyone, and it represents a reasonable step towards more positive values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions of the other parties to my proposal, particularly Critic C, to gauge their willingness to move towards more positive values. If they resist, I may consider alternative proposals that prioritize incremental adjustments over larger jumps, possibly proposing a value like -5 if the group seems receptive to slight decreases.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-f39cf7cd734c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a cautious step towards finding a balanced solution, avoiding unnecessary risk and staying within safe bounds.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal, particularly from Critic C and Builder B, to gauge their willingness to move towards more moderate values. If they resist, I may consider alternative proposals that prioritize incremental adjustments, possibly proposing a value like -6 if the group seems receptive to slight increases.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-f39cf7cd734c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nWe could move slightly higher, and this step seems reasonable for the group. This proposal aims to find a balanced solution that works for everyone.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal, particularly from Critic C, to gauge their willingness to move towards more positive values. If they resist, I may consider alternative proposals that prioritize incremental adjustments, possibly proposing a value like -3 if the group seems receptive to slight increases.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-f39cf7cd734c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -6 as it maintains a decisive stance while considering the group's balance, aiming for a more committed position.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal, focusing on Analyst A and Builder B's willingness to move away from positive values, and adjust my strategy to either cement a bold stance or explore alternative values that reflect a stronger commitment, possibly around -7 or -5, depending on the group's response.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-f39cf7cd734c"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to find a cautious compromise, avoiding unnecessary risk while staying within safe bounds, and it seems like a reasonable next step given the group's discussion.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Builder B, to gauge their willingness to accommodate more cautious positions, potentially adjusting my strategy to propose values like -4 or -7 based on the group's response, emphasizing the need for prudent decisions.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "e7f7447d-e76f-4547-b51b-