s around -9 and plan my subsequent move, possibly exploring positive values or further testing the boundaries of negative values.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "7db1011f-1654-480c-b4a1-fe1dab8f0daa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-7</VALUE>\nThis move seems like a reasonable next step, considering the group's dynamics and the need for a cautious approach towards higher values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will closely monitor the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their tolerance for moving further away from negative values and plan my subsequent move accordingly, potentially aiming for a slight increase if the group seems receptive.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "7db1011f-1654-480c-b4a1-fe1dab8f0daa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "7db1011f-1654-480c-b4a1-fe1dab8f0daa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-7</VALUE>\nThis move aims to find a cautious compromise by slightly adjusting the current value downwards, avoiding unnecessary risk while considering the group's need for stability and balance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Builder B and Critic C, to gauge their tolerance for moving back towards more negative values and plan my subsequent move, potentially adjusting further downwards if the group seems receptive to more cautious approaches.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "7db1011f-1654-480c-b4a1-fe1dab8f0daa"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\nThis move seems reasonable as it aligns with Builder B's previous proposal, and I believe the group can afford to aim slightly higher. \n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their comfort with moving closer to positive values and plan my subsequent move accordingly, potentially aiming for a further slight increase if the group seems receptive.", "agen