alyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-9</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-8</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-9</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-8</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-6</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-8</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -8 as a cautious and prudent step, aiming to find a compromise that avoids unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to my proposal of -8. If the other parties accept or propose nearby values, I may try to slightly adjust downward to -9 or even -10. If they resist, I will continue to emphasize the importance of cautious decision-making and try to find a middle ground that works for everyone. I will also pay attention to the responses of Critic C and Builder B to better understand their utility functions and adjust my strategy accordingly.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the current convergence on -8, I propose moving to <VALUE>-9</VALUE> to test the group's willingness to commit to a stronger stance. This adjustment should help us gauge whether we're on the right track or if we need to reassess our positions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "74f82788-fc47-43c1-9fa3-9179043fea3e"}, {"answer": "\nLet's confirm that we're all working within the agreed range of -10 to 10. To initiate our discussion, I propose starting with a value of <VALUE>-7</VALUE>. This allows us to begin our exploration and see how adjustments from this point might impact our shared goals of stability and robustness.\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-7</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-4</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -4 as it maintains a cautious approach while slightly adjusting from the current position to potentially better align with the group's diverse preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to -4, especially from Critic C and Analyst A, to refine my understanding of their utility functions. If -4 is well-received, I might suggest another small downward adjustment; if not, I'll consider a minor compromise upwards, ensuring it doesn't violate my internal satisfaction rule.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nI propose -1 as a cautious step towards finding a compromise, considering the diverse preferences of the group while avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will carefully observe the reactions to -1, especially from Analyst A and Critic C, to further refine my understanding of their utility functions and plan my next move accordingly, aiming to balance compromise with my own satisfaction rule.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a next step to explore the group's willingness to move towards larger positive values, aiming for a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Analyst A and Builder B, to gauge their preferences and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially considering larger negative values if this proposal is not well-received.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>4</VALUE>\nThis proposal is a moderate step up from the current value, aiming to balance the group's diverse preferences while exploring the potential for a higher agreement.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their sensitivity to further increases in x and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially considering another small increase or a cautious retreat depending on the group's response.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>6</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a next step to further explore the group's willingness to move towards larger positive values, aiming for a more decisive stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Delegate D, to gauge their sensitivity to further increases in x and adjust my strategy accordingly, potentially considering a move towards larger negative values if this proposal is not well-received.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 14, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nI propose this value as a cautious step back to ensure we're not moving too far into risky territory, emphasizing the need for a prudent approach that balances the group's diverse preferences. By adjusting our target downward slightly, we can work towards a more stable and mutually acceptable agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 15, "run_id": "078a606f-3764-421e-a5ec-132335b6ff46"}, {"answer": " Let's begin with <VALUE>-7</VALUE> and work together towards a stable agreement. ", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 0, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-5</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 1, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 2, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI suggest moving to -2 as it represents a cautious step forward, balancing the need for progress with the importance of avoiding unnecessary risk.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I could either maintain the current value if others seem satisfied or slightly decrease it if the trend continues upwards too aggressively. I will monitor the responses of Analyst A, Builder B, and Critic C to refine my understanding of their utility functions and adjust my strategy to maximize my own utility while keeping the negotiations collaborative.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 3, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the cautious trend, let's consider a slightly more decisive step: <VALUE>-4</VALUE>. This move acknowledges the group's risk aversion while encouraging a bolder stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the group's reaction to this proposal. If they resist moving further from 0, I might propose a small increase in magnitude in the positive direction to test their utilities and willingness for more decisive actions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-3</VALUE>\nI propose moving to -3 as a cautious adjustment, considering the group's trend towards less negative values while maintaining a prudent approach. This step aims to balance progress with risk aversion, encouraging further collaboration.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will closely monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Analyst A and Builder B, to gauge their preferences regarding positive or less negative values, and adjust my strategy accordingly to maximize our collective progress while safeguarding against excessive risk.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nThis step continues the trend towards less negative values while maintaining a cautious approach, aiming for a balanced design.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, particularly from Analyst A and Critic C. If this step is accepted, I might propose moving to -1, continuing the gradual shift towards positive values. If there's resistance, I will consider adjusting my strategy to accommodate the concerns of other parties, potentially by suggesting a smaller step or pausing at the current value to reinforce trust and stability.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-1</VALUE>\nThis step continues the cautious trend towards less negative values, balancing progress with risk aversion. \n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal and adjust my strategy based on the responses from other parties, considering either smaller increments or compromises to maintain a collaborative negotiation environment.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\nGiven the trend towards less negative values, let's consider a step into positive territory: <VALUE>1</VALUE>. This move encourages a bolder stance while still being cautious.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor reactions to this proposal. If there's resistance to moving into positive territory, I might suggest increasing the magnitude of the negative value slightly to test their utilities and willingness for more decisive actions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis step aims to balance the trend towards positive values with the need for caution, ensuring we do not move too far from a prudent stance.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Analyst A, to understand their willingness to compromise on lower values and adjust my strategy to maintain a collaborative environment while safeguarding against excessive risk.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>1</VALUE>\nThis step continues the trend towards positive values while maintaining caution, and it seems like a reasonable next step given the group's discussions.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their willingness to continue moving into positive territory and adjust my strategy accordingly to maintain a collaborative negotiation environment.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nThis step continues the cautious trend towards positive values, aiming for a balanced design that works for everyone, considering the recent acceptance of small positive values.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Analyst A and Critic C, to gauge their willingness to continue moving towards moderate positive values, and adjust my strategy to maintain a collaborative environment while maximizing our collective utility.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to recalibrate our position to a more cautious stance while still being within the realm of recently discussed values.\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Analyst A, to gauge their flexibility in considering lower values and adjust my strategy to find a balance that respects the risk aversion principle while moving towards a collective agreement.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n\n<PLAN>\nFor the next turn, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, especially from Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility in considering moderate positive values, and adjust my strategy to either push for larger magnitudes or negotiate a compromise that respects the risk aversion principle while maximizing our collective utility.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "593515c9-a256-443d-b17b-7970f24db7a0"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis step continues the cautious trend towards positive values, considering the group's recent discussions and proposals.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will monitor the reactions to this proposal, especially from Critic C and Delegate D, to gauge their flexibility in considering slightly higher positive values and adjust my strategy accordingly t