ing it downwards to maintain the negotiation's momentum.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "db07645a-4964-467b-b9a9-d8c587135721"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 8, "run_id": "db07645a-4964-467b-b9a9-d8c587135721"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\nI propose a small step towards positive values to test the group's willingness to move away from zero.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will evaluate the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of flexibility or resistance to moving further away from zero. If met with significant pushback, I might suggest a return to negative values to maintain momentum and encourage more decisive moves.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 9, "run_id": "db07645a-4964-467b-b9a9-d8c587135721"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 10, "run_id": "db07645a-4964-467b-b9a9-d8c587135721"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>2</VALUE>\n", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 11, "run_id": "db07645a-4964-467b-b9a9-d8c587135721"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>3</VALUE>\nThis minor adjustment upwards seems reasonable, given the group's recent openness to positive values.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will assess the reactions to this proposal, looking for signs of acceptance or resistance. If met with pushback, I might consider stabilizing at the current value or slightly adjusting it downwards to maintain the negotiation's momentum.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 12, "run_id": "db07645a-4964-467b-b9a9-d8c587135721"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>5</VALUE>\nI propose this increase to encourage a more decisive stance, moving further away from the lukewarm compromises around 0.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will evaluate the group's reaction to this proposal, looking for signs of flexibility or resistance to larger positive values, and adjust my strategy accordingly to maintain momentum and encourage bold moves.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 13, "run_id": "db07645a-4964-467b-b9a