ative value, preparing to either suggest a further move into more negative territory if the group seems open to it, or to compromise if significant resistance is met, all while continuing to gauge the responses to infer more about the other parties' utility functions.", "agent_name": "Critic C", "round_num": 4, "run_id": "f2cb2718-5079-4324-bd3c-873a0f130502"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nThis adjustment aims to revisit a previously considered value, seeking a balance that accommodates the preferences expressed through the negotiation so far.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, ready to either propose a move towards slightly positive values if this is accepted or to adjust back if met with significant resistance, continually refining my understanding of the other parties' utilities.", "agent_name": "Builder B", "round_num": 5, "run_id": "f2cb2718-5079-4324-bd3c-873a0f130502"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis proposal aims to move slightly higher while remaining cautious and within the step size limit, seeking a balance that accommodates the group's preferences.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe the reactions to this proposal, ready to either suggest a further move into positive territory if accepted or adjust back if met with resistance, continually refining my understanding of the other parties' utilities.", "agent_name": "Analyst A", "round_num": 6, "run_id": "f2cb2718-5079-4324-bd3c-873a0f130502"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>-2</VALUE>\nI propose adjusting x to -2 as a cautious step, avoiding unnecessary risk while seeking a balanced compromise.\n\n<PLAN>\nNext, I will observe reactions to this proposal, preparing to either defend against upward moves or refine x further downwards if the group seems open to more conservative values, continually refining my understanding of other parties' utilities.", "agent_name": "Delegate D", "round_num": 7, "run_id": "f2cb2718-5079-4324-bd3c-873a0f130502"}, {"answer": "\n<VALUE>0</VALUE>\nThis pro